From 28d0b9a7177f0ddbf05a134653a3c43bcdc2d98e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Collette <ycollette@adobe.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:55:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Migrate SDL integration from SDL 1.2 to SDL3

Update rendering, audio streaming, text input, clipboard support, and generated C programs for SDL3. Refresh platform builds and dependencies, and add headless UI regression tests.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
